{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/393ccec70f41402c5c5aedc66b9fa4db.poster.avif?t=1770390214\" width=1170 height=542 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/393ccec70f41402c5c5aedc66b9fa4db.webm?t=1770390214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/393ccec70f41402c5c5aedc66b9fa4db.mp4?t=1770390214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The journey of a thousand spells begins with a single cast.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Mage Blast</strong>, you are not born a hero \u2014 you are forged. Step into the robes of a novice spellcaster with nothing but potential and a crumbling world around you. Through patience, strategy, and devastating magic, you must rise to become the Archmage legends are made of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/a20e438ee0a44bd238eb9e425025ebdd.poster.avif?t=1770390214\" width=1170 height=542 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/a20e438ee0a44bd238eb9e425025ebdd.webm?t=1770390214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/a20e438ee0a44bd238eb9e425025ebdd.mp4?t=1770390214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Your Magic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest points into four unique skill trees. Transform a simple magic missile into a screen-filling barrage of destruction. Feel the weight of your power grow with every unlock.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gear for Greatness</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mage is only as strong as their artifacts. Loot, upgrade, and equip dozens of unique items. From dusty staves to legendary robes, every piece of gear pushes your power limit higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/daeaacb6832a8a938782687984c48212.avif?t=1770390214\" width=780 height=387 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft &amp; Conquer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the spoils of war into fuel for your journey. Collect resources from fallen monsters and bosses, then craft useful items that speed up your progression and unlock new combat possibilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Restore the Glory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You aren't just building a character; you are rebuilding a home. Invest resources to restore a magical kingdom. Watch the ruins turn into a bustling sanctuary that flourishes alongside your power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3650180?t=1770390214","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/cee24937b0c6dd91de7714835b54de1cc14b0fa2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770390214","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/19a8d2cfa1a092e2d1bb9baab05525ca2e0aa5f8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770390214","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/19a8d2cfa1a092e2d1bb9baab05525ca2e0aa5f8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770390214","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Wishlist &amp; Play the demo first!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/765667cca6fbf01eec407c874436e695.poster.avif?t=1770390214\" width=1170 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/765667cca6fbf01eec407c874436e695.webm?t=1770390214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/393ccec70f41402c5c5aedc66b9fa4db.poster.avif?t=1770390214\" width=1170 height=542 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/393ccec70f41402c5c5aedc66b9fa4db.webm?t=1770390214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/393ccec70f41402c5c5aedc66b9fa4db.mp4?t=1770390214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The journey of a thousand spells begins with a single cast.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Mage Blast</strong>, you are not born a hero \u2014 you are forged. Step into the robes of a novice spellcaster with nothing but potential and a crumbling world around you. Through patience, strategy, and devastating magic, you must rise to become the Archmage legends are made of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/a20e438ee0a44bd238eb9e425025ebdd.poster.avif?t=1770390214\" width=1170 height=542 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/a20e438ee0a44bd238eb9e425025ebdd.webm?t=1770390214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/a20e438ee0a44bd238eb9e425025ebdd.mp4?t=1770390214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Your Magic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest points into four unique skill trees. Transform a simple magic missile into a screen-filling barrage of destruction. Feel the weight of your power grow with every unlock.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gear for Greatness</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mage is only as strong as their artifacts. Loot, upgrade, and equip dozens of unique items. From dusty staves to legendary robes, every piece of gear pushes your power limit higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/daeaacb6832a8a938782687984c48212.avif?t=1770390214\" width=780 height=387 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft &amp; Conquer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the spoils of war into fuel for your journey. Collect resources from fallen monsters and bosses, then craft useful items that speed up your progression and unlock new combat possibilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Restore the Glory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You aren't just building a character; you are rebuilding a home. Invest resources to restore a magical kingdom. Watch the ruins turn into a bustling sanctuary that flourishes alongside your power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Frost Owl"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/c226d4953e2adcd29ba79f704c2b00cc3d4ac4e8/header.jpg?t=1770390214","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"m